Follow `AGENTS.md` in this repository. When `../development-control/RESUME.md` exists, read it before choosing work. That sibling is outside this public repository. If it is missing, use `docs/ROADMAP.md` and do not create the directory here.

Do not start a milestone marked PROPOSED. Do not treat tests as human approval. Do not approve or replace visual baselines unless the user explicitly asks.
